WEBVTT

00:07:28.561 --> 00:07:32.037
and even political crises
that lead to refugee crises --

00:07:32.061 --> 00:07:34.578
it takes all of these issues
and it exacerbates them,

00:07:34.602 --> 00:07:35.935
it makes them worse.

00:07:37.046 --> 00:07:38.312
I'm not a Rotarian.

00:07:38.784 --> 00:07:40.982
But when I gave my first talk
at a Rotary Club,

00:07:41.006 --> 00:07:45.584
I walked in and they had this giant banner
that had the Four-Way Test on it.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.117
Is it the truth?

00:07:48.141 --> 00:07:49.291
Absolutely.

00:07:49.611 --> 00:07:50.769
Is it fair?

00:07:50.793 --> 00:07:53.428
Heck, no, that's why I care
most about climate change,

00:07:53.452 --> 00:07:55.015
because it is absolutely unfair.

00:07:55.039 --> 00:07:57.428
Those who have contributed
the least to the problem

00:07:57.452 --> 00:07:59.238
are bearing the brunt of the impacts.

00:07:59.262 --> 00:08:00.458
It went on to ask: